          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Common.ST_Common",
          "Key": "Anomaly_047_a_1",
          "SourceString": "{0}，听说你以优异的成绩通过了笔试，真不愧是我的知音！\r\n不枉我提前准备好了你的实测邀约邮件——打字的时候爪子总卡在键盘缝隙里，拔不出来可费劲了！就知道你不会浪费我的苦心。\r\n接下来就该到实测环节啦。不用紧张，直接来找我就好。你肯定可以轻松通过的！\r\n快来幽灵号车站吧，我会在站台上等着你哦！\r\n浮游小姐",
          "LocalizedString": "{0}, I heard you passed the written test with flying colors. You really are my Soulmate!\r\nI'm glad I prepared your practical test invitation email in advance—my claws kept getting stuck between the keyboard keys, what a hassle to pull them out! I knew you wouldn't let my efforts go to waste.\r\nNow it's time for the practical test. Don't worry, just come and see me. I'm sure you'll pass with ease!\r\nCome to the Ghost Train station. I'll be waiting for you on the platform!\r\nMiss Levi"
